  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 37999102
    Key: howto.title
    Value: NASIL OYNANIR
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 32644992
    Key: howto.l1
    Value: "Herkes bedenin bir uzvunu y\xF6netir."
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 26149491
    Key: howto.l2
    Value: "FARE \u2014 elini / aya\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hareket ettir"
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 36193593
    Key: howto.l3
    Value: "SOL TIK \u2014 imlecin alt\u0131ndaki kayaya tutun"
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 95328796
    Key: howto.l4
    Value: "Tutununca kontrol di\u011Fer ele ge\xE7er: yukar\u0131 uzan, t\u0131kla,
      tekrarla!"
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 73969794
    Key: howto.l5
    Value: "Q / E / A / D \u2014 uzuv se\xE7  \xB7  SA\u011E TIK \u2014 b\u0131rak"
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 27629657
    Key: howto.l6
    Value: "Tutunan el seni kendili\u011Finden yukar\u0131 \xE7eker. Parlayan kaya
      = tutunabilece\u011Fin yer."
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 79449286
    Key: howto.l7
    Value: "Tek kolla uzun s\xFCre as\u0131l\u0131 kalma: kollar k\u0131zar\u0131r,
      titrer ve b\u0131rak\u0131r!"
  - SectionId: 89308091
    EntryId: 25288826
